WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Follow your curiosity. Several regions. Your choice.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.200
Talk. Listen. Discover. Conversations hold clues.

3
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.800
Look a little closer. Places have stories, too.

4
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:20.500
Take your clues somewhere new. You don’t need every answer to move on.

5
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.000
The clues click into place. Only here does it make sense.

6
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Understanding opens a new path. What you discover takes you further.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Understand more. Discover more.
